---
import { TextSection } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
  title: 'Legal notice | tevsys',
  description:
    'tevsys legal notice: ownership, nature of the product, intellectual property and limitation of liability.',
};
---

<Layout seo={seo} lang="en">
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>

    <h2>Ownership</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      tevsys™ is a software product developed independently, with no external investors, based in Barcelona
      (Spain). Contact: <a href="mailto:info@tevsys.io">info@tevsys.io</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Full identifying details of the rights holder (name or company name, tax ID and legal address) will be
      formalized with professional legal advice. Until then, this notice and the
      <a href="/en/company/terminos">Terms of use</a> describe the product and the scope of liability with
      operational honesty.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      All technology, design, operating logic, documentation and audiovisual content published on this
      website is the intellectual property of its creators.
    </p>

    <h2>Nature of the service</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      tevsys.io provides information about tevsys™, a <strong>local utility</strong> for MetaTrader 5 for
      risk management and operational discipline: it enforces the limits and rules configured by the user. It
      is not a broker, does not custody funds, does not issue trading signals and does not constitute
      financial, investment or trading advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      The tevsys™ trade name, its logo, the architecture of the Expert Advisor (EA) for MetaTrader 5, the
      product algorithms and layers (including, among others, HyperClose, SML and documented close precision)
      and all associated technical documentation are protected by intellectual property rights.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Reproduction, distribution or modification in whole or in part without express written authorization is
      prohibited.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      The user is solely responsible for their trading decisions and for configuring their limits. The
      execution environment (MetaTrader 5, broker, network, VPS or computer) is the user’s responsibility.
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Tick-by-tick monitoring only exists while MetaTrader 5 and tevsys are running. Without an active
      terminal, that monitoring is paused; the agreement state may remain stored and reattach on reload. When
      a limit is reached, tevsys processes and sends the close order; the final price is determined by the
      market and the broker (slippage, gaps, latency, liquidity).
    </p>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      Detail on scope, HyperClose, evidence and any financial liability cap is in the
      <a href="/en/company/terminos">Terms of use</a>. The operational description of gaps and monitoring is
      in <a href="/en/como-funciona#vigilancia-vps">How it works — monitoring</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Legal review</h2>
    <p class="tevsys-copy-muted">
      This legal notice will be completed and formalized with professional legal advice (ownership details,
      jurisdiction and alignment with applicable law). For any enquiry:
      <a href="mailto:info@tevsys.io">info@tevsys.io</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="legal-update">Last updated: 26 September 2026</p>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-update {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
